  "principle": "The teachable v1 slice: the prerequisite-closed set of foundation skills the daily loop instruments first (item banks, retrieval, frontier routing). Everything else in the graph is frozen — not taught and not grown — until every starter skill has ≥1 authored transfer item, a retrieval check, and a working frontier router. See docs/foundation-starter-set.md and docs/skill-graph-north-star.md (checklist item 4).",
